 ["h2", "yang-diukur", "Apa saja yang diukur", "What gets measured"],
 ["p", "Pengukuran yang tepat bergantung pada keluhanmu, tetapi kelompoknya selalu sama. Rentang gerak diukur dengan goniometer dalam derajat, di kedua sisi; reliabilitasnya baik bila prosedurnya distandarkan dan pengukurnya konsisten [3]. Karena itu, sebisa mungkin kamu diukur ulang oleh terapis yang sama dengan prosedur yang sama.",
  "The exact measures depend on your problem, but the groups are always the same. Range of motion is measured with a goniometer in degrees, on both sides; its reliability is good when the procedure is standardised and the measurer is consistent [3]. That is why, wherever possible, you are re-measured by the same therapist using the same procedure."],
